<title>USA: Fed's bill pass totaled $6.502 billion on Nov 6.</title>
<headline>Fed's bill pass totaled $6.502 billion on Nov 6.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's permanent addition of reserves to the U.S. banking system on November 6 totaled $6.502 billion, a spokesman for the New York Fed said.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
